                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_2"
              ]
            },
            "row_3": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What kind of photo should I upload?",
                "open_by_default": false
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_3": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>A clear, well-lit photo with your pet’s face and eyes visible works best. Avoid heavy filters or extreme blur.</p>",
                    "type_preset": "rte"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_3"
              ]
            },
            "row_4": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Can I print on the front or the back?",
                "open_by_default": false
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_4": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. You can choose front or back print placement when creating your tee.</p>",
                    "type_preset": "rte"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_4"
              ]
            },
            "row_5": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Is the shirt comfortable for everyday wear?",
                "open_by_default": false
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_5": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. It’s designed as an everyday soft tee—made for walks, weekends, and the moments that make life better.</p>",
                    "type_preset": "rte"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_5"
              ]
            },
            "row_6": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Will the fabric still resist fur after washing?",
                "open_by_default": false
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_6": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The smoother, anti-static construction is built into the fabric. Follow care instructions for best long-term results.</p>",
                    "type_preset": "rte"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_6"
              ]
            },
            "row_7": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Can I buy matching shirts?",
                "open_by_default": false
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_7": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Yes. The Pet Parent Set lets you create two personalized tees—great for couples or family members who share the same pet.</p>",
                    "type_preset": "rte"
                  }
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_7"
              ]
            },
            "row_8": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How long does delivery take?",
                "open_by_default": false
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_8": {
